OL,3,ADocuments falsified to evade tax on
OL,4,AAbramovich's wealth, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe world's biggest accountancy firm
OL,7,Fhelped in falsifying documents to hide
OL,8,FRoman Abramovich's wealth and evade
OL,9,Ftax, BBC Panorama has found.
OL,11,FAccounts signed off by Deloitte in
OL,12,FCyprus meant assets such as
OL,13,Fsuperyachts, mansions and private jets
OL,14,Fworth $672m (#508m) vanished from
OL,15,FAbramovich's company accounts.
OL,17,FDeloitte also appears to have advised
OL,18,Fon a scheme to evade a huge tax bill on
OL,19,Fthe oligarch's wealth through the
OL,20,Ffalsification of documents.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
