OL,3,ASouth Africa's deputy police chief
OL,4,Aresigns after being charged with sexual
OL,5,Aoffences
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Africa's deputy police chief has
OL,8,Fresigned three weeks after he was
OL,9,Fcharged with sexual offences.
OL,11,FA lawyer representing Lt Gen Shadrack
OL,12,FSibiya submitted his resignation letter
OL,13,Fat his disciplinary hearing on Monday,
OL,14,Fa police spokesperson said.
OL,16,FThe charges relate to allegations that
OL,17,Fhe sexually groomed a 16-year-old girl
OL,18,Fand raped an 18-year-old woman. He is
OL,19,Falso facing a charge of trafficking.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
